{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52729","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 四 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚，上下各一如连珠。\n命禄危非虚上呈，虚危之下哭泣星。\n哭泣双双下垒城，天垒团圆十三星，败臼四星城下横，臼西三个离瑜明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}